-- =====================================================================
-- Seed data. This is the ONLY seeding mechanism in the project: there is no
-- Java seeding routine (week 1 requirement). It runs after Hibernate has
-- created the schema (spring.jpa.defer-datasource-initialization=true).
--
-- IDs are generated by the database. Because the schema is recreated on every
-- start (ddl-auto=create-drop) the identity columns restart at 1, which the
-- foreign keys below rely on.
-- =====================================================================

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
-- 1. Users
--
-- Passwords are BCrypt hashes, never plain text. The matching plain-text
-- passwords are documented in README.md and on the login page:
--   admin    / admin123    (ROLE_ADMIN)
--   advisor1 / advisor123  (ROLE_USER)
--   advisor2 / advisor123  (ROLE_USER)
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
